# Single source of truth for line endings.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` normalises every text file to LF in the repository AND in
# the working tree on every platform, so a Windows checkout no longer depends on
# the machine's `core.autocrlf` setting. Prettier (`endOfLine: "lf"`) and ESLint
# (`linebreak-style: ["error", "unix"]`) therefore agree with what is on disk.
#
# After pulling this in for the first time, refresh an existing clone once:
#   git add --renormalize . && git status
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched by the eol filters.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
